      ],
      "message": "test: cover gettxspendingprevout error without txospenderindex\n\nWhen `mempool_only=false` is passed to a node without `txospenderindex`\nand the mempool has no spend for a requested outpoint, the RPC throws\n\"Mempool lacks a relevant spend, and txospenderindex is unavailable.\"\nThis path was not covered by any test.\n\nThe existing node2 query does not reach it because `mempool_only`\ndefaults to `true` when the index is unavailable. Pass it explicitly\nand check both cases: the call succeeds while the spends are still in\nthe mempool, and raises the error once they are mined.",
